# --- Checkpoints — never commit ---
# The one deliberate exception is the small calibrated head in model/weights/
# (head.safetensors ~770 KB + two small .json), so a judge can predict from a
# fresh clone without training. The frozen backbone is fetched by timm instead.
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.onnx

# --- Datasets ---
# Ignore everything under data/ EXCEPT the scripts that live there. `data/`
# alone would stop git descending into the directory, so the negations below
# would never be reached.
data/*
!data/prepare.py
!data/make_smoke_data.py

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# --- Node ---
# src/frontend/dist IS committed on purpose, so a judge needs no Node install.
node_modules/

# --- Scratch / OS ---
.DS_Store
*.log
preds.csv
runs/

# --- Source archives dropped in the project root (100s of MB) ---
*.zip
